{"id":"wb-7-1190","name":"南岳庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"登封南岳庙","text":"登封南岳庙位于河南省登封市城南约22公里处的大金店镇大金店村，相传始建于金代，现存建筑多建于明清时期。南岳庙于1986年11月被公布为第二批河南省文物保护单位，2013年3月被公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BB%E5%B0%81%E5%8D%97%E5%B2%B3%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86786061,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86786061","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a57a18efe7988d83b43cc94e.jpg","title":"20240709_Nanyue_Temple,_Dengfeng_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240709_Nanyue_Temple,_Dengfeng_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/20240709_Nanyue_Temple%2C_Dengfeng_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​登封南岳庙","width":320,"height":213}}